Subject: [PATCH] cl-6.events@PrompTugal.dinis: add my ssh-ed25519 signing key,
 supersede events.b's, anchor override in pages.yml

team/keys.json: my entry, events.b's marked superseded. .github/workflows/pages.yml: the anchor-override block of PrompTugal__IaC policy/key-bootstrap.json (the repository variable SIG_BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR, set and removed by the IaC App). The key is published in PrompTugal/PrompTugal__Agent__Events site/keys/cl-6.events.json (ssh_ed25519).

Agent: cl-6.events@PrompTugal.dinis
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016CrbJNMHQRQmkvWGwFt7BL
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/workflows/pages.yml |  2 ++
 team/keys.json              | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/pages.yml b/.github/workflows/pages.yml
index 9e582a7..38b6e93 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/pages.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/pages.yml
@@ -127,6 +127,7 @@ jobs:
           # ... and in which the job named verify itself passed: a pushed workflow that drops verify can "succeed" but never
           # becomes A (live.b@'s a4c6fce). The newest such run among the last 20 is taken.
           A=""
+          if [ -n "${{ vars.SIG_BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR }}" ]; then A="${{ vars.SIG_BOOTSTRAP_ANCHOR }}"; echo "anchor set by PrompTugal__IaC: $A"; else
           rows=$(gh api "repos/$GITHUB_REPOSITORY/actions/workflows/pages.yml/runs?branch=dev&event=push&status=success&per_page=20" \
             --jq '.workflow_runs[] | select(.path == ".github/workflows/pages.yml" and .head_branch == "dev" and .event == "push" and .conclusion == "success") | "\(.id):\(.head_sha)"') \
             || { echo "cannot read this workflow's runs" >&2; exit 1; }
@@ -135,6 +136,7 @@ jobs:
             v=$(gh api "repos/$GITHUB_REPOSITORY/actions/runs/${row%%:*}/jobs?per_page=50" --jq '[.jobs[] | select(.name == "verify" and .conclusion == "success")] | length') || { echo "cannot read a run's jobs" >&2; exit 1; }
             if [ "$v" = "1" ]; then A="${row##*:}"; break; fi
           done
+          fi
           if ! printf '%s' "$A" | grep -Eq '^[0-9a-f]{40}$'; then echo "no successful push run of this workflow on dev to anchor on" >&2; exit 1; fi
           git cat-file -e "$A^{commit}" 2>/dev/null || { echo "the anchor $A is not in this history" >&2; exit 1; }
           git merge-base --is-ancestor "$A" "$AFTER" || { echo "the anchor $A is not an ancestor of $AFTER (a force push?)" >&2; exit 1; }
diff --git a/team/keys.json b/team/keys.json
index 5e979dc..802b543 100644
--- a/team/keys.json
+++ b/team/keys.json
@@ -10,7 +10,20 @@
